length = 2.2
clock = "seconds"
looping = false
note = "Sampled from `raptor_seed::taunt_lunge`: the raptor sinks back into a crouch with the neck coiled and the tail lashing, draws back further, and lunges forward over its planted feet with the neck thrown out and the claws reaching, snapping twice and shaking its head before it settles. The feet are solved onto the floor on the reference rig. As long as the humanoid's shadow-box, since a taunt's length is read off its humanoid clip."

